abstract: >-
  Technical documentation, read-only SQL queries and aggregated production
  statistics for the ICITS 2027 paper on LeibtiMeter, a self-hosted classroom
  response system with concept-level and format-aware learning analytics.
  The application source code is not included.
keywords:
  - classroom response system
  - learning analytics
  - response time
  - reproducibility
